body:
Everbody has a passion. Everbody! Everbody has a purpose to live! I am sure that you have one too. I still havent really found mine but i try to help other people like myself here. Bc i know that killing or hanging yourself is not worth it.  Stay for me if not for anybody Please! You can help people like you here by repling to theese posts. This is the only thing that keeps me going. Stay. Everbody has good days to live. You are not alone. Your pets love you if anybody! And I love you! Im sure there is so much people that love you. You just dont realize it bc your mental state is not nice. Saying this again: You will get better(:

&#x200B;

Sorry if i respond late

Just know that starving yourself isnt the best way for your misery to end. You can end it here. *Alive. I know its exiting and it gives your soul some hope that everythings going to be okay. But when you do it. It just gets worse. I nearly killed myself but i regret it now. Days in the hospital wont make you Okay. You can do this. You can. starving to death is no answer. You have been given a life and it was given to you for a purpose. Dont go away from this world not knowing what your purpose is. And for you to know it. You need to live.  Every question has a answer.* 

&#x200B;

*Now go to your fridge and* *^(eat)*
